Description:
    Detects this app's stack (Rails version, test framework, database, linters,
    schema format) and writes:

      config/agent_harness.yml  settings for rails_agent_harness (kept on re-runs
                                unless --force)
      AGENTS.md                 agent instructions tuned to this app
      bin/agent-check           the checker
      .claude/settings.json     Claude Code hooks (merged into an existing file)
      .claude/skills/rails-review/SKILL.md
                                the rails-review skill

    No CLAUDE.md is created: Claude Code 2.1.277+ reads AGENTS.md when the
    project has no CLAUDE.md. If the app already has a CLAUDE.md (or
    .claude/CLAUDE.md), the generator adds an @AGENTS.md import to it, since
    Claude Code then reads only that file. Older Claude Code versions need a
    CLAUDE.md containing @AGENTS.md; create one and re-run. CLAUDE.local.md is
    never edited.

    AGENTS.md and an existing CLAUDE.md get a block between
    <!-- BEGIN rails_agent_harness --> and <!-- END rails_agent_harness -->
    markers. Existing content outside the markers is preserved, and re-running
    the generator only replaces the block.

Example:
    bin/rails generate agent_harness:install
